        <mxCell id="tK93tzaCFONGBUCUjE4C-61" value="&lt;b&gt;All modes → M10 readiness → confirmation → M11/M12 answer input + M13 viewer input&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Complete or meaningful verified partial evidence may proceed. Exact counts, exclusions and relationships require their own verified scope." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2f5f8;strokeColor=#8998a9;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#203344;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=20;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
